@startuml COM3_Engineering_Classes

title COM3 — Engineering Viewpoint — Operation Interaction Mechanisms

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "ENG-COMP-COM3-01\nOperation Declaration Binding" as E1 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-02\nInvocation Conformance Guard" as E2 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-03\nOperation Form Guard" as E3 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-04\nAnnouncement Completion Boundary" as E4 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-05\nInterrogation State Binding" as E5 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-06\nTermination Conformance Guard" as E6 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-07\nInvocation-Termination Binding" as E7 <<Engineering Mechanism>>
class "ENG-COMP-COM3-08\nSingle Termination Guard" as E8 <<Engineering Mechanism>>

E1 --> E2 : invocation
E2 --> E3 : conforming invocation

E3 --> E4 : Announcement
E3 --> E5 : Interrogation

E5 --> E6 : completion
E6 --> E7 : conforming termination
E7 --> E8 : establish once

note bottom
These elements project the authoritative
LCS-06 Engineering Specification.

No Engineering channel, interface, capsule,
cluster or binding object is introduced
unless independently specified.
end note

@enduml
